        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Feel the Magic of the Coziest Holiday!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a journey that delivers true Christmas wonder! &quot;Christmas Across America&quot; is your ticket to a magical winter America, where every town and every home breathes the spirit of the holiday. The scent of gingerbread and pine, the glow of garlands on every porch, the familiar melodies of carols—here, you don't just play, you immerse yourself in that very atmosphere of heartwarming family movies, where kindness, loved ones, and belief in miracles are what truly matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218410/extras/4e7f9c96abcad2eb86f178f1f7150a9a.poster.avif?t=1766133074\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218410/extras/4e7f9c96abcad2eb86f178f1f7150a9a.webm?t=1766133074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218410/extras/4e7f9c96abcad2eb86f178f1f7150a9a.mp4?t=1766133074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WHY THIS GAME WILL BECOME YOUR FAVORITE HOLIDAY TRADITION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a Festive Tour Across America:</strong> Hop on a holiday train, visit a bustling Christmas market, and go ice skating in Central Park. From California to New York, the entire continent sparkles with festive lights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become Part of a Heartwarming Family Story:</strong> Help little Lily and her family create the perfect Christmas—decorate the house, prepare treats, and dive into a world of kind traditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Coziness in Beloved Gameplay:</strong> Enjoy engaging hidden object searches and dozens of thematic mini-games—the perfect way to unwind and get into the holiday spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Collection of Warm Memories:</strong> Collect souvenirs from every state, unlock family recipes, and fill the house with festive coziness. Here, every found item is a piece of magic you create yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218410/extras/4b037554c42b41c6340f1c66a9bcd347.poster.avif?t=1766133074\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218410/extras/4b037554c42b41c6340f1c66a9bcd347.webm?t=1766133074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218410/extras/4b037554c42b41c6340f1c66a9bcd347.mp4?t=1766133074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE SPECIAL COLLECTOR'S EDITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those not ready to say goodbye to the holiday, we've prepared a special Collector's Edition! Extend the magic and discover even more Christmas wonder:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Stories:</strong> New locations filled with warmth and joy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive Collections:</strong> Unique holiday postcards and vibrant desktop wallpapers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus Puzzles:</strong> Extra mini-games and challenges for true holiday enthusiasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music Box:</strong> A dedicated player with classic Christmas melodies, so the holiday spirit plays on even outside the game.</p></li></ul>",
